Spec: SpecDD Path PSI Reference

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Represent clickable IntelliJ references for SpecDD path and glob candidates.

Owns:
  SpecDDPathReference.kt

Can modify:
  SpecDDPathReference.kt

Can read:
  SpecDDPathResolver.kt
  ../../../../../../test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/references/SpecDDPathReferenceBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Resolve exact path candidates to one PSI target when possible.
  Resolve glob candidates to all matching PSI targets.
  Return no target when a candidate is unresolved or ignored.
  Expose candidate text as canonical reference text.
  Keep references soft so unresolved paths are handled by the path warning annotator.

Must not:
  Report diagnostics.
  Modify target files.
